<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Retribution Paladin DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 3. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Retribution Paladin DPS Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
